# LEEWAY ENTERPRISE FILE HEADER
# File: .gitignore
# Path: .gitignore
# Project: LeeWay Enterprise Transit Hub
# Layer: Source Control Policy
# Purpose: Prevent generated output, credentials, and database runtime files from entering Git.
# Inputs: Local build and runtime artifacts.
# Outputs: Git exclusion rules.
# Mutation Scope: Source-control inclusion boundaries only.
# Dependencies: Git.
# Tests: git status and secret scan.
# Security Impact: Blocks common secret and local-data files.
# Database Impact: Blocks database data and backup files.
# Sovereign Cycle: Structure -> Veritas
# Status: ACTIVE / GOVERNED
# Human Comprehension: REQUIRED
# Owner: Leonard Lee / Leeway Industries
# Version: 1.0.0

# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Generated evidence
_evidence/
TestResults/
coverage/

# Local secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
appsettings.Local.json

# Database runtime files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
*.dmp

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

*.trn
operations/docker/sqlserver/.env
